{"root":{"data":{"id":"dl8ohk13jso0","created":1788743039274,"text":"算法性能分析方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8ohuewr740","created":1788743061877,"text":"理论分析方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oib6e11k0","created":1788743098367,"text":"渐近分析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oim0cvy00","created":1788743121947,"text":"通过数学工具描述算法性能随输入规模增长的趋势时间复杂度与空间复杂度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl8oicjjvso0","created":1788743101340,"text":"平均情况分析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oiohqans0","created":1788743127351,"text":"考虑所有可能输入的分布<br>计算算法在各种输入情况下的<br>平均性能"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl8oii4ig2o0","created":1788743113491,"text":"最坏情况分析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oiq8misg0","created":1788743131154,"text":"关注导致算法性能最差的<br>输入情况"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl8ohw83q2w0","created":1788743065819,"text":"实验分析方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oisqpxeg0","created":1788743136602,"text":"基准测试"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oiwh33hc0","created":1788743144727,"text":"评估算法在不同场景下的性能<br>在相同测试用例上<br>比较不同算法的表现"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl8oit58u2o0","created":1788743137480,"text":"性能剖析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl8oiyxfcbk0","created":1788743150068,"text":"使用性能剖析工具监控<br>CPU 时间、内存使用等资源消耗<br>识别性能瓶颈并提供优化依据"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl8ohwop2g00","created":1788743066823,"text":"统计分析方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl8ohx0p7x40","created":1788743067548,"text":"可视化分析方法"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}